      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1105.1998",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We show a connection formula of the Hahn–Exton q-Bessel function around the origin and the infinity. We introduce the q-Borel transformation and the q-Laplace transformation following C. Zhang to obtain the connection formula. We consider the limit p →1−of the connection formula.",
